# Cloudflare Pages serves clean URLs automatically (/docs -> docs.html, and 308s
# /docs.html -> /docs). Do NOT add `/docs /docs.html 200` style rewrites here: they
# collide with that built-in behavior and cause a redirect loop. Add only real
# redirects below (e.g. moved pages).

# One canonical host. Both of these previously answered 200 with the full site, which
# splits ranking signals across three hostnames and, worse, lets someone sign in on a
# host that is not in the Supabase Auth redirect allow-list (only provenrail.com is), so
# their magic link would bounce. Domain-scoped rules match the request host; per-deploy
# preview URLs (<hash>.provenrail.pages.dev) are a different host and stay reachable.
https://www.provenrail.com/* https://provenrail.com/:splat 301
https://provenrail.pages.dev/* https://provenrail.com/:splat 301
